        "message": "Resolve the device identity under one lock\n\nTwo threads resolving on first launch could each mint a random UUID and the\nloser would register with an identity that is immediately overwritten. Hold\nthe lock across the whole resolution, not just the cache read and write.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>",
