        "message": "Tell the customer how to resolve a device-limit rejection\n\nA \"key bound to another device\" verdict was a dead end: the app showed the\nbare server text, which reads like the KEY is simply broken. The one path out\n— ask an admin to free the slot — was not discoverable. Append the exact\nAdmin steps and the device's own HWID so support can identify the stale\nbinding, and let the multi-line message wrap instead of truncating.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>",
